flowchart TB
  Repo[Git repository]
  Repo --> FE[frontend/ independent Vite app]
  Repo --> BE[backend/ independent Express app]
  FE --> Pages[src/pages]
  FE --> Components[src/components]
  FE --> State[src/store + slices]
  FE --> Services[src/services: Axios and Socket.IO]
  Services --> API[HTTP/socket contract]
  BE --> Routes[routes]
  Routes --> Middleware[middleware]
  Routes --> Controllers[controllers]
  Controllers --> Models[models / Mongoose]
  Controllers --> Utils[utils/socket + notification helper]
  Models --> Mongo[(MongoDB)]
  Utils --> Redis[(Redis adapter/presence)]
  FE -. frontend/vercel.json .-> Vercel[Vercel SPA rewrite]
  BE -. root vercel.json .-> Vercel
  Lock[backend pnpm lock only; no root workspace] -.-> Repo
